# D-2: the state words of sockets, servers, watchers and requests cannot
# name what the network statements make.
open udp and call it closed
listen for tcp on port 0 and call it stopped
start get from "http://127.0.0.1:1/" and call it pending
watch folder "." and call it watching
connect to tcp "127.0.0.1" on port 1 and call it connected
connect to websocket "ws://127.0.0.1:1" and call it connecting
get "http://127.0.0.1:1/" into completed
on data from closed
    failed is true
.
